        "integrated_multimodal_description:\n[Shot 1] A woman in a dark green raincoat stands at a harbour railing at dusk, facing the camera from the centre of the frame. She lifts her right hand from the railing and pushes wet hair back from her forehead, then turns her head to look off to the left edge of the frame. The camera slowly pushes in from a medium shot to a medium close-up. Rain falls steadily; harbour lights blur into orange circles behind her.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSteady rain on water and on the fabric of the coat. Low harbour swell slapping against a stone wall. A distant foghorn sounds once, far off to the right.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
